Guests often compliment Azhar for his jovial nature. He is reliable, resourceful, and easy-going. Besides hosting, he loves travelling, listening to music, cooking, gardening and binge watching on Netflix.

Azhar has always been passionate about starting a venture in the travel and hospitality industry. This led to the start of his hosting journey! He is an entrepreneur. At present, he works and lives in a different city. However, he has employed professional staff at the property to ensure a comfortable stay experience for the guests.

Interaction With Guests:
Though Azhar is physically not present at the property, he is always a phone call away for his guests.</p><a>Read More</a></div></div><span class="HostInfoUI-styles__HostImg-sc-92f945d6-6 gakEFT"><div class="dwebCommon-styles__CenteredDivWrap-sc-69c1848f-1 UserAvatar-styles__WrapperDiv-sc-3673863a-0 hGCZNW gkWFYt"><span class="UserAvatar-styles__TextStyles-sc-3673863a-1 cYpEOE">A</span></div></span></div></div></section><div id="dontHaveData"></div><div id="hotel-policies" class="Policy-styles__PolicyStyledWrapper-sc-e953658d-0 fVkqh"><div class="Policy-styles__PolicyHeaderStyled-sc-e953658d-1 evnsbA"><h2 class="Policy-styles__PolicyHeaderTextStyled-sc-e953658d-2 grvxJl">Property Policies</h2><p class="Policy-styles__TimingPolicyWrapper-sc-e953658d-3 kjuumL"><span>Check-in Time: <strong>12 PM</strong> </span><span>Check-out Time:<!-- --> <strong>11 AM</strong></span></p></div><div class="dwebCommon-styles__BaseColumnWrap-sc-69c1848f-2 ljwJcs"><div class="dwebCommon-styles__BaseColumnWrap-sc-69c1848f-2 ljwJcs"><ul class="HouseRules-styles__FeatureListUL-sc-e2b75f77-2 jXdAfI"><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" height="1.5rem" width="1.5rem" margin="0px 1rem 0px 0px" fill="#46484d" class="HappyCheckPointIcon-sc-8325df94-0 gSSXOJ"><path d="M8 0c4.418 0 8 3.582 8 8s-3.582 8-8 8-8-3.582-8-8 3.582-8 8-8zm3.73 4.171c-.307-.032-.609.104-.788.357L7.507 9.213c-.03.04-.076.066-.126.07-.05.004-.1-.014-.135-.05L5.622 7.846c-.337-.325-.872-.32-1.204.01-.331.332-.336.867-.01 1.204l2.473 2.234c.16.162.38.252.607.252h.069c.25-.02.478-.146.626-.348l4.144-5.655c.186-.247.225-.576.102-.86-.124-.284-.39-.48-.698-.512z" /></svg><p class="HouseRules-styles__ListPara-sc-e2b75f77-1 HugMz">Primary Guest should be atleast 18 years of age.</p></li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" height="1.5rem" width="1.5rem" margin="0px 1rem 0px 0px" fill="#46484d" class="HappyCheckPointIcon-sc-8325df94-0 gSSXOJ"><path d="M8 0c4.418 0 8 3.582 8 8s-3.