feel at home","data":[{"type":"Host","name":"Azhar","gender":"Male","about":"Azhar is all set to welcome you. He has been hosting since 2023.\n\nGuests often compliment Azhar for his jovial nature. He is reliable, resourceful, and easy-going. Besides hosting, he loves travelling, listening to music, cooking, gardening and binge watching on Netflix.\n\nAzhar has always been passionate about starting a venture in the travel and hospitality industry. This led to the start of his hosting journey! He is an entrepreneur. At present, he works and lives in a different city. However, he has employed professional staff at the property to ensure a comfortable stay experience for the guests.\n\nInteraction With Guests:\nThough Azhar is physically not present at the property, he is always a phone call away for his guests.","generalInfo":[{"text":"Hosting since 2023","iconUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fpromos.makemytrip.com\u002Faltaccoimages\u002Ficons\u002Fhosting_time.png"},{"text":"Speaks English, Hindi, Kannada","iconUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fpromos.makemytrip.com\u002Faltaccoimages\u002Ficons\u002Flanguage.png"},{"text":"Fully vaccinated","iconUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fpromos.makemytrip.com\u002Faltaccoimages\u002Ficons\u002FCovid.png"}]}]}},"highlightedAmenitiesTag":"Amenities and Services","highlightedAmenities":["Wi-Fi","Private Dining Area","Private Parking","Onsite Parking is available","Parking is available for 1 Car","Parking available for free"],"highlightedAmenitiesV2":[{"title":"Wi-Fi","code":"INTRNT"},{"title":"Private Dining Area","code":"DINING"},{"title":"Private Parking","code":"PRKG"},{"title":"Onsite Parking is available","code":""},{"title":"Parking is available for 1 Car","code":""},{"title":"Parking available for free","code":""}],"locationPersuasion":["HSR Layout","2.6 km drive to Central Silk Board"],"sharingUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.goibibo.com\u002Fhotels\u002Fvenus-homes-hotel-in-bangalore-7013165553200440407?mHotelId=202311301956486507&checkin=2026-10-03&ch