<li itemscope=\"\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ListItem\" class=\"style__NoLinkBreadcrumbListItem-sc-olbt81-5 jaIRih\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span itemprop=\"name\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tVenus homes, Bangalore\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"6\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t<\/ol>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n","isLLM":false,"aboutContent":"  <div >\n    <div class=\"hotelDetailDescWrapper\">\n   <div class=\"aboutHotelDetailMainWrapper\">\n      <div class=\"aboutHotelDetailHeaderMainWrapper\">\n         <h2 class=\"aboutHotelDetailMainHeader\">About Venus homes<\/h2>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"aboutHotelDetailContentMainWrapper\">\n         <div class=\"aboutHotelDetailContentMainWrapperInner\", id=\"hotelDescContent\">\n            <div class=\"hotelDetailDescContent\">\n            <strong>Overview<\/strong> <br> <br>Venus homes is a great choice for travellers looking for a  star hotel in Bangalore. This Hotel stands out as one of the highly recommended hotel in Bangalore. Hotel is rated  out of 5, which is considered as very good. <br> From all the <a href=https://www.goibibo.com/hotels/budget-hotels-in-bangalore-cg/ >Budget hotels in Bangalore<\/a>, this property is very much popular among the tourists. <br><br>A smooth check-in/check-out process, flexible policies and friendly management garner great customer satisfaction for this property. The Hotel has standard Check-In time as 02:00 PM and Check-Out time as 12:00 PM. <br><br>You can find numerous <a href=https://www.goibibo.com/hotels/hotels-in-bangalore-ct/> hotels in Bangalore<\/a> under different categories and this property is one the best hotel under its category.<br><br>\n            <\/div>\n         <\/div>\n         <a class=\"readMoreCta\" id=\"readMoreBtn\" onclick=\"handleReadMore()\">Read More<\/a>\n      <\/div>\n   <\/div>\n   <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n"}</script>